  "_readme": "Concept lexicon for the fuzzy detector. A concept lists every surface form that means the same thing in a rental conversation. Adding a new slang term here improves every rule that mentions the concept, which is why this scales where flat keyword lists do not. Forms are matched after whitespace and punctuation are stripped, so spacing variants need no separate entry.",

